    "description": "Supreme Villagio is a gated villa community by Supreme Universal in Somatane, off the old Mumbai-Pune highway, about 10 minutes from Dehu Road. After its sold-out first phases of 3 BHK townhouses and 5 BHK twin villas, the next phases bring 4 BHK townhouses and 4 BHK twin villas, all ground plus two storeys with a top terrace and a private garden. The 4 BHK townhouses have about 2,000 to 2,200 sq ft of carpet area and 3,400 to 4,000 sq ft of usable area including the terrace and garden, from \u20b92.89 crore all inclusive; the 4 BHK twin villas have about 2,400 to 2,450 sq ft of carpet area and 3,800 to 4,900 sq ft of usable area, from \u20b93.31 crore all inclusive, and add a maid's room with its own toilet and walk-in wardrobes. About 65% of the land is open space, including a 3.5-acre central boulevard landscaped by Site Concepts International under Singapore-based design director Mark Mahan, with a mini forest, maze garden, bird nesting pavilion, blossom, butterfly and spice-and-herb gardens, a yoga lawn and deck, jungle gym, reflexology park, fitness plaza, multipurpose sports court, jogging loop, meditation deck, barbecue court and party lawn, and a pool with a kids' pool. The ready-to-use Club Villagio has a double-height lobby, mini theatre, indoor games, banquet hall, community workspace and caf\u00e9, gym and yoga room and a kids' play area. Homes have laminated wooden flooring in the master bedroom, vitrified tiles elsewhere, a modular kitchen with hob, chimney and water purifier, gypsum false ceilings and a video door phone, and the community has managed security, CCTV, access control and concierge services. Nigdi is about 15 minutes away, Baner and Balewadi about 30 and Hinjewadi about 35. Phase III is registered with MahaRERA as P52100055048, with RERA possession in October 2028, and Phase IV as PR1263032502135.",
