    "description": "Nirvana by Nirman Greens is a luxury residential project on Survey No. 224/1, Aundh-Baner Link Road, Baner, bordering the green expanse of Pallod Farms. It has three towers. Tower A rises 31 floors with just two homes per floor: a 4 BHK of 2,550 sq ft and a 4.5 BHK with a family lounge of 3,179 sq ft. Towers B and C, of 14 floors each, have two 3 BHK homes of 1,445 sq ft per floor. The 4 BHK is offered at \u20b95.61 crore and the 4.5 BHK at \u20b96.91 crore, all inclusive, each with three covered car parks, and the project is nearing possession, planned for December 2026. The 4.5 BHK has two master suites, one with a jacuzzi, two more bedrooms, a 12'9\" x 18'3\" family area, a 38 ft living and dining room, a helper room and a 23'9\" sit-out; the 4 BHK has a 30 ft living and family area, a separate dining room, two master suites with walk-in wardrobes and a 30 ft sit-out. Homes have marble flooring in the living room, dining, kitchen, bedrooms and bathrooms, a fully furnished modular kitchen with a hob, chimney, water purifier and oven, system windows, veneer-finished doors, home automation in the living and dining area, air conditioning in the living room, dining and bedrooms, boilers in all bathrooms and 100% generator backup. The clubhouse has a lap pool with an infinity edge, a kids' bubbler pool, a rock-climbing wall, a multipurpose hall, a cricket pitch and a sports court; the ground level adds a gym and sauna, spa rooms, a squash court, a jogging loop, a billiards deck, a leisure lounge, outdoor work stations, a cr\u00e8che, indoor and outdoor kids' play areas and a vehicle-free zone. Tower A's rooftop has a covered infinity-edge pool and an infinity sky bar with a stargazing lounge and barbecue courtyard, and Towers B and C share a rooftop yoga deck, outdoor fitness station and sky garden lounge. The project is registered with MahaRERA as P52100047528.",
