    "description": "Tulip Infinity Evana is a high-rise residential project at Rasikwadi, Punawale, Pune, by Varma Corp (the new name of the Tulip Group) with S.M. Group as joint-venture partner. It is registered with MahaRERA as P52100078470 under the name Infinity Evana, with a revised completion date of 30 October 2029. The 6-acre site has four towers of 41 floors above a ground and four-level podium, and about 2 acres of open space. The towers face the Pawana river, and the site is about 200 metres from the Mumbai-Bengaluru highway service road near the Pawana river bridge at Ravet. Wings C and D have 2 BHK homes of 799 and 845 sq ft and 3 BHK homes of 1,054 and 1,126 sq ft. Wing A has 3 BHK homes of 1,150, 1,210 and 1,269 sq ft and a 1,482 sq ft 4 BHK. Wing B is a 4 BHK-only tower with two homes of 1,477 and 1,481 sq ft on each floor and three lifts. The developer's 2026 price sheet starts at \u20b91.35 Cr for the 1,054 sq ft 3 BHK and \u20b92.03 Cr for the 4 BHK. Amenities include a covered pool and an infinity-edge pool, gym, squash court, mini theatre, spa, co-working space, pickleball court, multipurpose turf and a pet park. The shops and offices in the road-facing podium are listed separately as Tulip Infinity Evana Commercial.",
