    "description": "Codename Light is a Vastu-compliant residential project in Keshav Nagar, Mundhwa, Pune, by Esson Landmarks, Unitary Properties and Suyog Group, on Keshav Nagar Road near Renuka Mata Mandir. Spread across 4.5 acres, it is planned around three elegantly rising towers with about 1.1 acres of lifestyle and amenity space. The homes are 2 BHK of 775 to 787 sq ft and 3 BHK of 993 to 995 sq ft (total carpet area including balconies), with wide balconies and efficient layouts that let in natural light. A 2 BHK comes with one car park and a 3 BHK with two. Indicative all-inclusive prices start at \u20b993 lakh for a 2 BHK and \u20b91.22 crore for a 3 BHK. More than 35 amenities include a rooftop swimming pool with vanishing edge and water cascade, kids pool, clubhouse and banquet hall, gym, yoga and Zumba rooms, spa and salon, amphitheatre and movie amphitheatre, temple court, party lawn, Miyawaki forest, play court and children's play areas. The upcoming Keshav Nagar\u2013Kharadi bridge is about 7 minutes away, Koregaon Park 10 minutes, Magarpatta City 12 minutes, EON IT Park 15 minutes and Pune Airport 20 minutes. The project is registered with MahaRERA as LIORA (PR1261012501453), valid until 31 March 2029.",
